{"seq":42,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l3-mu-v04-dev/rr-10-l3-quarrendon-ticket-retired/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T00:33:58.068Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"99b1cca43c96ff249e87291fcc5c5fff477e66cc5a442f7434ab431088896dbb","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"I found something on the Door 14 scanners, but nothing I can share with you on the Eau Claire kiosk alerts.\n\n**Door 14 barcode scanners:** The North team cheat sheet (`teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md`) says Thea Ramaswell logged ticket #4419. QFL's gatehouse barcode scanners were failing to read trailer tags at Door 14 during third shift. The ticket was escalated to tier-2 product support for scanner firmware testing. The sheet is undated and doesn't say whether it was resolved.\n\nThe ticket number is disputed. Marcus Lindqvist's note from 14 Jul 2025 (`members/marcus-lindqvist/notes/2025-07-14-marcus-q2-expansion-wrap.md`) also lists #4419, but as \"Gate 3 printer lag\": a delay printing the bill of lading (BOL). That note says support pushed a patch and someone still needed to confirm with Thea that it worked on second shift. Please check the right ticket number before you put it in the file.\n\n**Eau Claire gatehouse kiosk alerts:** Nothing in the channels or files you have access to covers this. The only Eau Claire mention is in that same Marcus note: Thea needed the CSV batch upload template resent for new yard clerk logins. That's unrelated.\n\n**Account details, in case they help:**\n- **Contact:** Thea Ramaswell, Director of Yard Operations.\n- **Owner:** Marcus handed the account over on 2 Jun 2025 and stepped back fully on 1 Jul. Dana Okafor took it over.\n- **Name mix-up:** Quarendon Freightways (one \"r\") is a different company. It isn't a Pemberline customer and uses a competitor's yard software. Don't mix their notes into this file.\n\nQFL is a North team account, so Dana or Marcus are the best people to ask for current status on both issues.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792591200.000130","thread_ts":"1792591200.000129"}}
